  <PrefabDef>
    <defName>RimAgent_TrapCorridorStarter13</defName>
    <label>trap-corridor starter 13x13</label>
    <description>Temporary landing base, no DLC; meant to be torn down and rebuilt once the colony settles, so any material works. The north half is one open hall: three beds sharing a single end table, a poker table, chess table and horseshoes pin for meals and joy, and shelves along its south side for goods that deteriorate (basic materials can stay outside). Doors on the west and east walls. South-west a prison cell with four beds (a hospital if there are no prisoners); south-east a research room with its own table so researchers do not eat on the floor. Between them a one-cell corridor open to the south runs to a door into the hall: line it with traps to break early raids. Based on the 13x13 starter module by 编号tc97 (Bilibili BV1GszSBoEfM).</description>
