  <PrefabDef>
    <defName>RimAgent_Freezer13</defName>
    <label>freezer 13x13</label>
    <description>The first real building after landing; finish it before the starting food runs out. Needs power (Electricity and Air conditioning research). One big freezer: rows of shelves with walkways, two electric stoves on the west wall so meals are cooked next to the raw food, four coolers in the outer walls, a standing lamp at the crossing. South-east a butcher room (butcher table, a door into the freezer and one outside). Doors in the middle of all four outer walls, so it joins neighbouring 13x13 modules on any side; wooden doors are fine early, autodoors later. Based on freezer No. 1 by 编号tc97 (Bilibili BV1GszSBoEfM); the coolers there vent into tiny unroofed pockets in the corners, here they sit in the outer walls instead so no roof has to be removed.</description>
